Reconcile operator permissions from this release

Usage:
  mcp-runtime cluster operator-rbac [command]

Available Commands:
  apply       Apply the shipped operator ClusterRole and optional MCP Auth binding

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for operator-rbac

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging

Use "mcp-runtime cluster operator-rbac [command] --help" for more information about a command.
